<title>USA: FSA qualifies Bethlehem, N.Y., issue for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies Bethlehem, N.Y., issue for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said it has qualified for insurance Bethlehem, N.Y.'s $13.5 million of general obligation school bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
